        "l": 37.0,
        "t": 694.2723,
        "r": 548.7279999999998,
        "b": 673.1428210084034
      },
      "content": "This Service Manual, \"18' & 24' ADA Built-In Dishwashers' (Part No. W11187658), provides the In-Home Service Professional with service information for the '18' & 24' ADA Built-In Dishwasher.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0006",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "section": "FORWARD",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 37.0,
        "t": 652.2723,
        "r": 544.54,
        "b": 631.1428210084034
      },
      "content": "The Wiring Diagram used in this Service Manual is typical and should be used for training purposes only. Always use the Wiring Diagram supplied with the product tech sheet when servicing the dishwasher."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0007",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "section": "FORWARD",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 37.0,
        "t": 610.2723,
        "r": 555.6879999999999,
        "b": 589.1428210084034
      },
      "content": "For specific operating and installation information on the model being serviced, refer to the 'Use and Care Guide' or 'Installation Instructions' provided with the dishwasher."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0008",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "section": "GOALS AND OBJECTIVES",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 198.21,
        "t": 538.4943999999999,
        "r": 396.804,
        "b": 523.7207010526315
      },
      "content": "GOALS AND OBJECTIVES",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0009",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "section": "GOALS AND OBJECTIVES",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 37.0,
        "t": 504.6724,
        "r": 556.2879999999999,
        "b": 482.5469210084034
      },
      "content": "The goal of this Service Manual is to provide information that will enable the In-Home Service Professional to properly diagnose malfunctions and repair the '18' & 24' ADA Built-In Dishwasher.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0010",
      "reading_order": 13,
      "section": "GOALS AND OBJECTIVES",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 37.0,
        "t": 461.6764,
        "r": 252.37599999999992,
        "b": 452.5469210084034
      },
      "content": "The objectives of this Service Manual are to:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0011",
      "reading_order": 14,
      "section": "GOALS AND OBJECTIVES",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 51.0,
        "t": 446.6724,
        "r": 308.58400000000006,
        "b": 437.54292100840337
      },
      "content": "Understand and follow proper safety precautions."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0012",
      "reading_order": 15,
      "section": "GOALS AND OBJECTIVES",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 51.0,
        "t": 431.6724,
        "r": 327.82000000000016,
        "b": 422.54292100840337
      },
      "content": "Successfully troubleshoot and diagnose malfunctions."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0013",
      "reading_order": 16,
      "section": "GOALS AND OBJECTIVES",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 51.0,
        "t": 416.6724,
        "r": 257.8479999999999,
        "b": 407.54292100840337
      },
      "content": "Successfully perform necessary repairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0014",
      "reading_order": 17,
      "section": "GOALS AND OBJECTIVES",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 51.0,
        "t": 401.6724,
        "r": 392.068,
        "b": 392.54292100840337
      },
      "content": "Successfully return the dishwasher to its proper operational status."
    },
